# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-23 18:42:07 UTC

Base revision: `d4e9c7ac` on `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`.
This append-only run record refreshes the server-free P18-V02 checks after
adding sustained local-offset persistence coverage. No product source changed
since the previous 2,000-concurrent-send stress addition.

## P18-04 coverage

Added `repeated_offset_persistence_keeps_long_running_snapshot_restorable` to
the local offset store tests. It writes and checks 128 snapshots of eight
queues, then reopens the store and verifies all final offsets. Added it to the
offline stress runner and README, bringing the suite to 19 cases repeated
three times. Existing remoting start/shutdown ownership, concurrent runtime
construction, reconnect, pending cleanup, callback shutdown, concurrent
producer sends, and consumer ownership race cases cover the other enumerated
start/stop and shutdown boundaries.

